  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Local support for maritime mission</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This purpose of this project is to support the Netherlands embassy (EKN) in Abidjan to facilitate a maritime trade mission, organised by the Netherlands Enterprise Agency (RVO) and EKN Abidjan, from the Netherlands to Port Autonome de Abidjan (PAA) and Port Autonome de San Pedro (PASP). This includes the organisation/logistics of the mission programme, and local support for the implementation of an impactful programme and local matchmaking. The maritime trade mission aims to conclude the two studies delivered in the project PCB22CI01 by presenting these to Ivorian government parties, and PAA and PASP, and to identify and leverage business and follow-up opportunities involving Dutch knowledge and expertise.The mission will also explore adjacent opportunities in the maritime sector, namely those identified by Invest International; and connect with potential future local partners.</narrative>
  </description>
